 "messages": [
  {
   "id": "lTMGtvxiAAAJ",
   "from": "Jenni Poutanen",
   "author": "68d5f085a403524f",
   "date": "2017-11-22T13:33:07Z",
   "subject": "Modelling behavioral response",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hi group,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I have an issue concerning modelling behavioral response\r\nwith my white-tailed deer encounter history data. <br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">My edf and tdf files are attached here. I\r\nhave 27 individuals and 7 of them have been recaptured. There are three sampling\r\noccasions in the dataset. <br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I tried to model behavior (D~1,p0~b,sig~1),\r\nbut got the following error message:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\" lang=\"EN-US\">In\r\nsqrt(diag(solve(myfit$hessian))) : NaNs produced</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\" lang=\"SV\">&gt; </span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\" lang=\"SV\">mb</span></span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\"> Model:<span>  </span>D ~ 1 p0 ~ b sig ~ 1</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">Run time:<span>  </span>8.027167<span>  </span>minutes</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"> AIC:<span>  </span>341.5535</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">Summary table: </span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>                </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">Estimate<span>    </span>SE<span>      </span>z P(&gt;|z|)</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">p0.(Intercept)<span>    </span>-1.825 0.493 -3.700<span>   </span>0.000</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">p.behav<span>          </span>-20.998<span>   </span>NaN<span>    </span>NaN<span>     </span>NaN</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">sig.(Intercept)<span>    </span>5.142 0.163 31.634<span>   </span>0.000</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">d0.(Intercept)<span>    </span>-2.069 0.275 -7.527<span>   </span>0.000</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">psi.constant<span>       </span>0.223 0.387<span>  </span>0.576<span>   </span>0.565</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\">*Density intercept is log(individuals per pixel) </span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>Nhat(state-space) = exp(d0.)*nrow(ssDF)</span></pre><pre style=\"line-height:10.25pt;background:white;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>  </span>(caution is warranted when model contains density covariates)</span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">So does this mean that this can&#39;t be run?\r\nAnd if so, why is this? <br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thanks for your time,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jenni Poutanen</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">PhD student</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Section of Ecology</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Biology Department</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">University of Turku, Finland</span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>"
    ]
   ]
